  "_comment": "Notice/overlay screens for the LVGL frontend. Edit text/colour/position/image/font here and restart the app — no recompile needed. Fonts must be one of the compiled names (see lvgl_notice_loader.cpp). Position with either \"pos\":[x,y] (absolute) or \"align\"+\"offset\". Colours are #rrggbb. Image src uses the \"A:\" runtime asset prefix.",

